      "answerText": null
    },
    {
      "id": "stadt-varel-gap-3",
      "translation": "ኣብ Kurhaus Dangast ሓደ ቁራጽ ኬክ ሩባርብ ንበልዕ።",
      "answerText": null
    },
    {
